476","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-d004c4e3371af3fa942a","layer":"original","quote":"又从攻谭于南皮，冀州平。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":54},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o064c-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-bbda43a18f268bb91c8f","layer":"original","quote":"十年正月，攻拔之，斩谭及图等。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":371,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":96,"end":111},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-684adf372b31795beec5","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-c43038671a6cb4b7444f","layer":"original","quote":"从破袁谭于南皮，复增邑凡二千户。是时天下户口减耗，十才一在，诸将封未有满千户者；而绣特多","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":76,"end":120},{"id":"liusima-q-89c21f65eff1bdd285ac","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖进攻谭，谭战死","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":717,"end":726},{"id":"wudi-e-o100a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1ca17316b02d7b4d213c","layer":"original","quote":"十年春正月〖1〗，攻谭，破之。斩谭，诛其妻子〖2〗，冀州平。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":557,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2e98e13ca098117a86e9","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2e98e13ca098117a86e9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十年：建安十年（公元 205）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":560,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-a9b0434ee8de64aed40f","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o100","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1ca17316b02d7b4d213c","layer":"original","quote":"十年春正月〖1〗，攻谭，破之。斩谭，诛其妻子〖2〗，冀州平。﹝一﹞下令曰：“其与袁氏同恶者，与之更始〖3〗。”令民不得复私仇，禁厚葬；皆一之于法〖4〗。是月，袁熙大将焦触、张南等叛〖5〗，攻熙、尚；熙、尚奔三郡乌丸〖6〗。触等举其县降，封为列侯。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":557,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-3b4ebaf56da54f7c5b11","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-d3d33978547fafd309bf","layer":"original","quote":"太祖既破冀州，谭又叛。太祖遂引军攻谭于南皮","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":180,"end":201}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
